          en: 'Write ab = (2a)·b / 2. From 2a + b ≥ 2√(2ab): 6 ≥ 2√(2ab), so ab ≤ 36/8 = 4.5, attained at 2a = b = 3, i.e. a = 1.5, b = 3.',
